msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 10,000 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Inner Release Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>14,000<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Primal Ruination Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
