msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 6,000.<br>Potency increases up to 12,000 as your HP decreases.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Comeuppance Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Blackblood</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
