msgid "Deals ice damage with a potency of 20,000 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Afflicts target with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Deep Freeze</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Deep Freeze Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Target is temporarily unable to act<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>3s<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Umbral Ice</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Elemental Star</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
