msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 6,000 to all enemies in a cone before you.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Absorbs 100% of damage dealt as HP<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Zanshin Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
