msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 10 to all enemies at the designated area.<br>Potency scales with item level.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>4s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Triggers traps at the designated area"
