msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 210 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br>Potency scales with item level.<if ($gn108 >= 5)><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>5% chance to kill target instantly, with some exceptions</if>"
