msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 210 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br>Potency increases to 500 when used against undead enemies.<br>Potency scales with item level.<if ($gn108 >= 6)><br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Silver Cannon</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.</if>"
